    "display_name": "Comment Your Code",
    "long_instructions": "# Comment Your Code\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Show that you understand how your app works by explaining key parts of your code.\r\n\r\nAdd short, clear comments that explain:\r\n\r\n* **Your async fetch function**\r\n  What does it request? When does it run?\r\n\r\n* **Your event listener logic**\r\n  What happens when a user clicks a button?\r\n\r\n* **Your try/catch block**\r\n  What errors are you protecting against?\r\n\r\n* **Your loading or empty state logic**\r\n  When do these appear and why?\r\n",
